                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <div class="testimonial-stars">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>
                    <p class="testimonial-text">"The best guided tour I've ever had! Lenawei Safaris is truly top-notch. From flight bookings to hotel arrangements, everything was handled professionally. We felt like VIPs throughout our journey!"</p>
