                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <div class="testimonial-stars">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>
                    <p class="testimonial-text">"Outstanding service! We booked our complete trip through Lenawei – flights, hotels, safari, and beach resort. Everything coordinated perfectly. Can't wait to return!"</p>
