            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Safari Map Section -->
        <section id="safari-map" class="content-section">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>🗺️ Safari Destinations & Maps</h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle">Explore Kenya's most iconic wildlife destinations</p>
            </div>
            
            <img src="images/safari-map.jpg" alt="Kenya Safari Map showing all major destinations" class="map-image">
            <p class="map-destinations"><strong>Featured Destinations:</strong> Masai Mara • Amboseli • Tsavo • Lake Nakuru • Great Rift Valley • Mount Kenya • Coastal Regions</p>
        </section>

        <!-- Meet Our Team Section -->
        <section id="team" class="content-section">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>👥 Meet Our Experienced Team</h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle">Our dedicated professionals bring decades of combined experience in travel, tourism, wildlife, and hospitality. Each team member is passionate about creating unforgettable experiences.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="team-grid">
                <div class="team-member">
                    <div class="member-avatar">👨‍💼</div>
                    <h3>Lucas Bell</h3>
                    <p class="member-title">Founder & Lead Guide</p>
                    <p class="bio">With 20+ years of safari guiding experience, Lucas is passionate about wildlife conservation and providing exceptional guest experiences. He personally oversees all major safari expeditions and ensures premium service standards. His extensive knowledge of East African ecosystems is unmatched.</p>
                    <p class="expertise"><strong>Expertise:</strong> Wildlife Photography • Naturalist Guiding • Safari Operations • Wildlife Conservation</p>
                    <div class="social-links">
                        <a href="https://instagram.com/belllucas34" target="_blank" class="social-btn instagram">
                            <span>Instagram</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="team-member">
                    <div class="member-avatar">👩‍💼</div>
                    <h3>Pauline Tamara</h3>
                    <p class="member-title">Guest Relations & Logistics Manager</p>
                    <p class="bio">Pauline is the heartbeat of our customer service team. With her warm personality and meticulous attention to detail, she ensures every guest receives personalized attention. She coordinates hotel bookings, accommodations, and guest communications with precision and care. Her problem-solving skills are exceptional.</p>
                    <p class="expertise"><strong>Expertise:</strong> Customer Service • Booking Coordination • Group Management • VIP Relations</p>
                    <div class="social-links">
                        <a href="https://instagram.com/ptama_rah" target="_blank" class="social-btn instagram">
                            <span>Instagram</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="team-member">
                    <div class="member-avatar">👨‍✈️</div>
                    <h3>Titus Gitonga</h3>
                    <p class="member-title">Safari Operations Manager</p>
                    <p class="bio">Titus manages our entire fleet operations and safari logistics with military precision. His organizational expertise ensures that every vehicle is maintained to the highest standards and every safari runs like clockwork. Safety and comfort are his top priorities, and his team respects his leadership.</p>
                    <p class="expertise"><strong>Expertise:</strong> Fleet Management • Operations • Vehicle Maintenance • Logistics Planning</p>
                    <div class="social-links">
                        <a href="https://instagram.com/to.sh342" target="_blank" class="social-btn instagram">
                            <span>Instagram</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="team-member">
                    <div class="member-avatar">👨‍🦓</div>
                    <h3>Jackson Wachiuri</h3>
                    <p class="member-title">Senior Safari Guide & Naturalist</p>
                    <p class="bio">Jackson is a certified naturalist with extensive knowledge of East African wildlife and ecosystems. His storytelling abilities and eagle eye for spotting wildlife make every game drive an educational adventure. He's fluent in English, Swahili, and French, and his passion for conservation is infectious.</p>
                    <p class="expertise"><strong>Expertise:</strong> Wildlife Biology • Tracking • Bird Watching • Cultural Heritage • Language Skills</p>
                    <div class="social-links">
                        <a href="https://instagram.com/jacksonescapes" target="_blank" class="social-btn instagram">
                            <span>Instagram</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="team-member">
                    <div class="member-avatar">👩‍🔬</div>
                    <h3>Lucy Kago</h3>
                    <p class="member-title">Wildlife Conservationist & Environmental Specialist</p>
                    <p class="bio">Lucy is dedicated to wildlife conservation and sustainable tourism practices. She educates guests about conservation efforts, endangered species, and how tourism supports environmental protection. She partners with conservation organizations throughout Kenya and actively participates in research projects.</p>
                    <p class="expertise"><strong>Expertise:</strong> Wildlife Conservation • Environmental Education • Sustainability • Research</p>
                    <div class="social-links">
                        <a href="https://instagram.com/lucy_kagoh" target="_blank" class="social-btn instagram">
                            <span>Instagram</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="team-member">
                    <div class="member-avatar">💻</div>
                    <h3>Travel Specialists Team</h3>
                    <p class="member-title">Flight, Rail & Transportation Booking Team</p>
                    <p class="bio">Our dedicated team of travel specialists handles all flight bookings, rail arrangements, and ground transportation coordination. They stay updated on the latest fares, schedules, and travel requirements to get you the best deals. With access to major GDS systems, they provide comprehensive travel solutions.</p>
                    <p class="expertise"><strong>Expertise:</strong> Airline Partnerships • Rail Bookings • Ground Transportation • Visa Assistance • Fare Optimization</p>
                </div>

                <div class="team-member">
                    <div class="member-avatar">🚗</div>
                    <h3>Professional Drivers & Escorts</h3>
                    <p class="member-title">Certified Transportation Team</p>
                    <p class="bio">All our drivers are certified, background-checked, and trained in advanced driving techniques and first aid. They are courteous, knowledgeable about Kenya's routes, and dedicated to safe, comfortable travel experiences. Each driver undergoes continuous professional development.</p>
                    <p class="expertise"><strong>Expertise:</strong> Vehicle Operation • Route Navigation • Safety Protocols • Customer Service • Emergency Response</p>
                </div>

                <div class="team-member">
                    <div class="member-avatar">🏨</div>
                    <h3>Hotel Partnership Coordinators</h3>
                    <p class="member-title">Accommodation Specialists</p>
                    <p class="bio">Our hotel coordinators have established relationships with 500+ properties across Kenya. They negotiate best rates, handle special requests, and ensure you get the perfect accommodation that matches your preferences and budget. They're available 24/7 for guest support.</p>
                    <p class="expertise"><strong>Expertise:</strong> Hotel Selection • Rate Negotiation • Special Arrangements • Guest Preferences • Quality Assurance</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- FAQs Section -->
        <section id="faqs" class="content-section">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>❓ Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle">Find answers to common questions about our services and safari packages</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="faq-grid">
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <h3>🎒 What is the best time for a safari?</h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="faq-content">The best time is during the dry seasons: June to October (longer dry season) and January to March (shorter dry season). During these periods, wildlife is easier to spot as animals congregate around remaining water sources. However, each season offers unique experiences and advantages. The green season (November-May) offers lush landscapes and bird watching opportunities.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <h3>💉 Do I need vaccinations before traveling?</h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="faq-content">Yes, we strongly recommend Yellow Fever and Malaria vaccinations. Typhoid, Tetanus, and Hepatitis A/B vaccinations are also advisable. We recommend consulting your doctor 4-6 weeks before travel. We can provide vaccination center recommendations and documentation. Travel insurance with medical coverage is also highly recommended.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <h3>📄 What documents do I need?</h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="faq-content">A valid passport (6+ months validity), visa (if required), travel insurance, vaccination certificates, and copies of important documents. We provide complete visa assistance and documentation support. We recommend keeping digital copies of all documents in a secure location.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <h3>💰 What's included in the safari package?</h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="faq-content">Packages typically include transportation, accommodation, meals, professional guides, park entrance fees, and game drives. Specific inclusions vary by package. We offer detailed itineraries with clear breakdowns of all included services. International flights may be booked separately unless specified in your package.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <h3>🔒 Is safari travel safe?</h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="faq-content">Yes, safari travel is generally safe when conducted with professional operators. We employ experienced guides, maintain strict safety protocols, provide comprehensive travel insurance, and operate within national park regulations. Safety is our top priority. We follow all government safety guidelines and maintain excellent safety records.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <h3>👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Are safaris suitable for families with children?</h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="faq-content">Absolutely! We offer family-friendly safari packages with accommodations suitable for children. Our guides are experienced in working with families and adapt activities to children's interests and abilities. We recommend age 6+ for traditional safaris, though we can arrange special accommodations for younger children.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <h3>✈️ How do I book flights through you?</h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="faq-content">Contact our booking team with your travel dates and requirements. We'll search multiple airlines, provide quotes, and handle all arrangements including seat selection, luggage, and special requests. We have partnerships with major airlines for competitive fares.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <h3>🏨 Can you help with hotel bookings?</h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="faq-content">Yes! We partner with 500+ hotels, lodges, and resorts. We can arrange any accommodation from luxury 5-star to budget-friendly options and often secure exclusive discounts. We provide detailed property information, photos, and guest reviews.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <h3>🚗 Do you provide airport transfers?</h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="faq-content">Yes, we offer professional airport transfers with meet-and-greet services. Our drivers hold welcome signs, assist with luggage, and ensure comfortable, punctual arrival at your destination. We cover all major airports in Kenya including JKIA, Mombasa, and Kisumu airports.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <h3>❌ What's your cancellation policy?</h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="faq-content">Our cancellation policy is flexible: cancel 30+ days before travel for full refund, 15-30 days for 75% refund, 7-14 days for 50% refund. Travel insurance can provide additional protection. We also offer date change options. Review specific package terms for details.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <h3>💬 What languages do your guides speak?</h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="faq-content">Our guides are fluent in English and Swahili. Many also speak French, German, Spanish, and other languages. We can arrange guides in your preferred language with advance notice. We maintain a diverse team to serve international guests.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                        <h3>📞 How can I contact you for custom itineraries?</h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="faq-content">Contact us via email, phone, WhatsApp, or our website contact form. Our travel specialists will discuss your preferences, budget, and requirements to create your perfect custom itinerary. We're available 24/7 for consultations.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Contact Us Section -->
